# Reloved Frontend Design System

Archetype: **Neo-Brutalist Streetwear & Digital Wall of Kindness**. High contrast, paper/wall texture, hard offset shadows, bold type. Do not invent a different visual language.

## Tokens (`frontend/src/index.css` `@theme`)

Use Tailwind token classes, never one-off hex unless adding a missing token.

| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `background` | `#F4F1EA` | Page canvas |
| `surface` | `#FFFFFF` | Cards, nav, containers |
| `surface-muted` | `#EBE7DF` | Muted paper |
| `concrete` | `#E6E4E0` | Concrete accent |
| `foreground` | `#111111` | Ink text + 2px borders |
| `foreground-muted` | `#595959` | Captions/metadata only |
| `accent-green` | `#C6F136` | Primary CTA, positive |
| `accent-blue` | `#2A48FF` | Links, verification |
| `accent-red` | `#FF4D3E` | Manifesto, danger, FREE |
| `accent-yellow` | `#FFDE59` | Tags, being-matched |
| `accent-pink` | `#FF66C4` | Reloved / given |

If `accent-yellow` or `accent-pink` are missing from `@theme`, add them there instead of hardcoding hex in components. Borders must be `border-foreground` (`#111111`), not the old light `--color-border`.

## Box model (non-negotiable)

- Borders: `border-2 border-foreground` on cards, buttons, inputs, pills, containers.
- Corners: `rounded-none` everywhere. `rounded-full` only for circular badges/dots.
- Hard shadows (no blur): small `shadow-[2px_2px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]`, standard `shadow-[4px_4px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]`, hero `shadow-[6px_6px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]` or `8px`.
- Press: `hover:shadow-none hover:translate-x-[4px] hover:translate-y-[4px] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all`.
- Ink on neon: always `text-foreground` on green/yellow/pink. Never gray text on bright accents.

## Typography

- Headings, badges, buttons, nav, section titles: `font-display` (Bricolage Grotesque), `font-black uppercase tracking-tight` or `tracking-widest`, tight leading (`leading-none` / `leading-tight` / `leading-[0.85]`).
- Body, descriptions, input values, tables, fine print: `font-sans` (Manrope).

## Forbidden

- Purple-to-blue gradients, glowing colored drop-shadows, glassmorphic dark UI, `rounded-2xl` / `rounded-3xl` blob cards.
- Do not keep or extend `glass-panel`, `rounded-full` buttons, or padded-pill inputs in `Button.tsx` / `Input.tsx` / `Card.tsx` when touching those files — migrate them to this system.
